"""What each module's constants are read from: the names it publishes, in order,
each with the C preprocessor condition it is published under and the macro it
reads when that is not its own name; the {"NAME", MACRO} tables it publishes,
each entry with its condition; the HAVE_* configure features its conditions
test; and, for posix, the functions its method table holds, with the
condition each is compiled under. gen_constants.jac probes these against a
target's headers. Taken once from the C modules these Jac ports replace; see
jac/jaclang/runtime/python/LICENSE.cpython.
"""

